Gruihuq
$cards
DECK 1 {SPADES, HEARTS, CLUBS, DIAMONDS}

$initial
DRAW 37 DEAL NUWO
NUWO 6 FACE_HALF
NUWO 8 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
NUWO 1 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST

$moves
MOVE NUWO NUWO
OR
    AND
        DESTSRC Suit match_color
        DESTSRC Rank ascending
    AND
        DEST Empty
        DEST Empty
MOVE_STACK NUWO NUWO
SRCSTACK Rank descending
DRAW
PILE ALL NUWO Empty
$win
OR
    PILE ALL DRAW Empty
    AND
        PILE ALL DRAW Empty
        PILE ALL DRAW Empty
